WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,500
It's the armored vehicle that boss Liu Aoye got up to pick up the customers.

2
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:14,660
We have a free RV to do Zhang Wei, look

3
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,460
We now have a cooperative relationship

4
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:17,860
We were in the service area just now

5
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,180
Your formal skills

6
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,420
It's simply amazing

7
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:22,580
Even the requiem charm can be affixed with instant noodle soup

8
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:24,620
This is definitely not something ordinary folk artists can do

9
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:25,900
Your ability

10
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:27,380
I don’t know which master is being released?

11
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:33,300
It's just family crafts that are passed down by experts or not. They were all taught by my father. Your father is my father. He is just a man in the mountains.

12
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:37,580
The bad-tempered old man guarding the Po Dao Crown gave the vacant key wire an order of 200,000 yuan.

13
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:38,500
Just give me two hundred yuan for travel expenses

14
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:39,780
Do you think this is something humans do?

15
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:42,900
This is pure capitalist exploitation of your sect.

16
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:48,220
Or can you tell me your father's name conveniently? We in the 749th Bureau have great respect for all the experts.

17
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:51,680
What would you do if you could carry a case with us?

18
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:57,400
Our official can give the green light, no, no, I really can’t say what your sect has.

19
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:58,480
Rules of confidentiality that cannot be respected

20
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:01,560
Or is it useless to say that something poisonous happened?

21
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:03,000
Mainly when I go down the mountain

22
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:04,440
My dad took the thousand-ply base cloth

23
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:06,840
Pointed at my nose and threatened me if I dared to be outside

24
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:09,800
Use his name to show off or reveal the details of your family.
